linux-rockchip64-ysp-maxline-@PROFILE@ (@VERSION@) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Build the @PROFILE@ maximum-mainline RK3588 integration profile from the
    pinned Linux v7.3-rc2 base commit df2908090cda3 and the exported
    integration delta in kernel-versions/maxline/patches/.
  * Rebased from the 2026-08-23 shipped-v7.2 pin. 55 of the 299 public
    commits are now redundant against v7.3-rc2 and were dropped, including
    ten complete proposal series that reached Linus.
  * Refreshed five proposal series to their current public revisions:
    Synopsys DW-DP v8 to v11, Rockchip usbdp cleanup v13 to v14, rkisp2 v1
    to v3, Samsung MIPI DC-PHY v2 to v4, and RK3588 crypto v2 to v3.
  * Package a unique kernel release, DTB tree, and headers for Armbian,
    co-installable beside every other kernel slot.
  * Compile-verified only. No maxline profile has been installed or booted
    on a ROCK 5B; a successful build is not a hardware result.

